#[doc("""
The apex of the compiler pipeline. `compile_source` runs every pass in
order for one input, `run` dispatches a parsed command line to it, and
`parse_cli` reads that command line. The import resolver, the cached
core loader and the AST dumper sit beside them.
""")]

